          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuba kwehlele phezu kwenu igazi lonke elingelacala elachithwa emhlabeni, kusukela egazini likaAbela olungileyo kuze kufike egazini likaZekariya indodana kaBarakiya, elambulala phakathi kwethempeli lealtare.",
          "type": "text",
