              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba ngithi kini: Kalisoze langibona futhi kuze kufike isikhathi sokuba lithi: Ubusisiwe ozayo ebizweni leNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
